    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nModern 1-Bedroom Apartment at East Wharf, East Wall, Dublin 3\n\nStep into your new home at East Wharf, where stylish design and modern comforts create an ideal living environment. \n\nThese spacious 1-bedroom apartments are perfect for individuals looking for a vibrant lifestyle in the heart of Dublin 3's East Wall, conveniently located between Clontarf and Dublin's North Docklands. Every detail is designed to maximize comfort and convenience, making it an excellent choice for today's renter.\n\nApartment Highlights\n\n• Open-Plan Living Area: A spacious, well-lit living area that's perfect for relaxing or hosting friends.\n\n• Modern Kitchen: Fully equipped with quality appliances and ample storage, ideal for everything from quick meals to dinner parties.\n\n• Comfortable Bedroom: A cozy, private space with generous wardrobe space, creating a peaceful retreat.\n\n• Elegant Bathroom: Modern, sleek finishes and high-quality fixtures for a touch of luxury.\n\nExclusive Resident Amenities\n• Residents Lounges: Perfect for remote work, studying, or simply relaxing with neighbours in a productive atmosphere.\n\n• On-Site Gym: Keep fit without leaving home with a mix of gym equipment.\n\n• Rooftop Garden: Unwind with views over Dublin, an excellent spot to relax, socialize, or enjoy a quiet moment.\n\n• The soon to be opened adjoining Moxy Hotel, providing stylish hospitality, dining options, and more.\n\nA Connected Lifestyle in East Wall, Dublin 3 Living at East Wharf means you're just minutes from Docklands, IFSC, and central Dublin. \nPublic transport options, including DART (850 metres on Howth Road) and buses, make getting around easy. \n\nThe surrounding neighbourhoods are vibrant and known for cafes, shops, and parks, with Fairview Park only metres away. \nExperience a new way of living at East Wharf—your stylish, connected, and comfortable home awaits."
      },
